  "problem": "Solve $(4-3x)^{8}+12<9.$",
  "worked_solution": "Isolating the eighth-degree term, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(4-3x)^{8}+12 & <9 \\\\ (4-3x)^{8} & <-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, $(4-3x)^{8}\\ge 0$ for all values of $x$ because the power $(8)$ is even.\n\nTherefore, there is no solution to the given inequality.",
